.Dd October 26, 2026
.Dt XTC-ABI-STABILITY 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xtc-abi-stability
.Nd ABI stability and deprecation policy for xtc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the operational summary of the xtc compatibility contract.
The full reference, which marks each rule as enforced by a gate or as
policy only, is
.Pa docs/abi-stability.md .
.Sh VERSIONING
.Bl -tag -width "MINOR"
.It Sy PATCH
Bug fixes only.
Same ABI, on-disk formats and trace shape.
.It Sy MINOR
Additive only: no symbol removed or renamed, no enum renumbered, no
public struct field moved or resized.
A minor may append a field to a size-first struct.
.It Sy MAJOR
Breaking changes allowed; new SONAME
.Pq Pa libxtc.so.MAJOR
and new base symbol version.
.El
.Pp
The promise covers headers whose opening comment says
.Ql @stability stable ;
a
.Ql @stability experimental
header may change in any minor.
.Sh SIZE-FIRST STRUCTS
Every caller-allocated option, info, callback and stats struct starts
with
.Vt size_t Va size ,
set by its initializer
.Pq for example Dv XTC_PROC_OPTS_INIT
to the caller's
.Fn sizeof .
The library reads an input and writes an output only up to
.Va size ;
fields past it take their defaults, a
.Va size
of 0 is
.Dv XTC_E_INVAL ,
and a newer caller's unknown nonzero tail is
.Dv XTC_E_VERSION .
.Fn XTC_FIELD_OK p field
tells a consumer whether a struct the library sized contains
.Va field .
.Sh ENFORCEMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It Pa test/abi/test_abi_sized.c
an N-1 consumer under AddressSanitizer: no read or write past
.Va size .
.It Pa test/dist/test_abi_layout.sh
every public struct's sizeof and field offsets against
.Pa test/abi/layout.txt .
.It Pa test/m0/test_symbols.sh
the export set, and the
.Ql XTC_<MAJOR>.N
symbol version on every export
.Pq Pa dist/libxtc.map .
.It Pa test/dist/test_stability_tiers.sh
exactly one tier per installed header.
.It Pa scripts/abi-check.sh
release-time
.Xr abidiff 1
against the previous tag.
.El
.Sh DEPRECATION
.Dv XTC_DEPRECATED Ns Pq Ar msg
marks a declaration; a use warns with
.Ar msg .
A symbol deprecated in minor N keeps working for the rest of its major
and is removed no earlier than the next major.
Define
.Dv XTC_NO_DEPRECATION_WARNINGS
to silence the warnings.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr xtc 7 ,
.Xr xtc-build 7
.Pp
.Pa docs/abi-stability.md ,
.Pa docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md .
